---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 17,
  title: 'Day 17',
  date: '2026-09-22',
  description: 'seventeenth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I installed linux, and even with my new iPad it didn't work as
          I wanted so, I somehow configurate everything I even opened Chromium,
          but I couldn't find anything (becouse chromium didn't work) soo, I
          changed idea and I use Rust Desk ,It works well, but I always need to
          have my laptop on, so I think about buy router with WOL function, It
          alows to turn on my laptop remotly, It's exactly what I need but now,
          I can't spend my money that easily, I also watched "The shawshank
          redemption" it was quite good movie, and I was at badminton training
          and I packed for my studies
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll go to work, good if I'll cut my hairs a bit, and I want to bring my
        reading habit to life but in diffrent way, not after wake up, but before
        going to sleep, for at least 10min, I hope I'll end Witcher (becouse I
        didn't yet) and there are two options I'll find another book worth
        listning or I'll listen next book of Witcher both sounds good for me I
        need to use Empik Go, becouse I paid so It must be worth for me
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll gave 2/10, I was just playing with my iPad, and watched movie, It
          doesn't sounds like a good day but It was everything I did today (I
          didn't count training becouse It's a hobby)
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={2} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
